# Vectors: golden bitcode vectors, each a value's encoding by name.
#
#     let vectors: <this type> = (open tests/vectors/engine.nuon)
#
# A test encodes each named value with the pinned bitcode and holds the bytes
# to its row; `BLESS=1` rewrites the table when an encoding moves on purpose.
# `type` is the value's Rust type, its module paths dropped, the name the
# protocol's fixture driver decodes it by. `hex` is the bytes in lowercase hex,
# two digits a byte.

table<
    name: string,
    type: string,
    hex: string
>
